{"version":1,"content":"<p>Morten Christensen第一次通過交易獲得參加美國總統當勞·特朗普晚宴的資格，花了大約1200美元。第二次花了約500美元。而這一次，他説自己最終反倒賺了6美元。為了獲得入場資格，Christensen買入特朗普迷因幣，同時另行押注幣價下跌，以便從跌勢中獲利。前兩次活動，他採用的也是這套策略。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587618.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.235371+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:57:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"c7c819cfd5b3c3fe6f0e1dfa6799b003f61a90029efbda979d6a5b7a8c5cb47d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}